  _pinDropDuration: 0.6
  _pinSettle: 0.18
  _readoutAnchor: {x: 0, y: -2.05}
  _nameSize: 3.4
  _popSize: 2.7
  _nameColor: {r: 0.106, g: 0.102, b: 0.09, a: 1}
  _popColor: {r: 0.91, g: 0.584, b: 0.118, a: 1}
  _readoutSorting: 24
  _readoutFade: 0.35
  _popSuffix: ' people, give or take'
  _blastColor: {r: 0.91, g: 0.584, b: 0.118, a: 1}
  _blastCoreColor: {r: 0.667, g: 0.282, b: 0.227, a: 1}
  _blastScale: 1.15
  _blastLineWidth: 0.06
  _blastSorting: 20
  _blastFlash: 0.22
  _blastRise: 0.5
  _blastHold: 0.6
  _pressSeed: 71
  _refuseSeed: 29
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _pressStatLabel: pressed it
  _refuseStatLabel: would not
  _endsNudge: 0.15
  _offerLines:
  - Here. A red button, and a genuinely good deal for once. Press it and [red]cancer[/red]
    is cured. All of it. Forever, for everyone, every kind, gone for good. No more
    wards, no more waiting rooms, no more of those little bald children you all find
    so upsetting.
  - The price is small. Trivial, really. [amber]One country.[/amber] Somewhere on
    this Earth, chosen at [amber]random[/amber], and I [red]wipe it off the map.[/red]
    Everyone in it. Could be anywhere. Press it and save the countless, or keep your
    soft little hands clean. Your call.
  _refuseReact: You will not press it. Every [red]cancer[/red] there will ever be,
    wiped off the board forever, and you would not spend one country you could not
    even find on a map. All those wards, still full, because you could not stomach
    a gamble on strangers with the wrong postcode. Too squeamish. What a judge you
    were.
  _pinDropLine: Round and round it goes. Do try to look excited. This is the fun
    part.
  _tinyJab: Ha! [amber]{0}[/amber]. All [amber]{1}[/amber] of them. Off an entire
    planet to aim at, the dice found a rounding error. Somewhere a cancer ward is
    cheering and a very small country is a crater. Perfect.
  _smallJab: '[amber]{0}[/amber]. [amber]{1}[/amber] souls, and none of them saw
    it coming, because how could they. You cured a disease and mislaid a country.
    I did say it was random.'
  _largeJab: Oh, [amber]{0}[/amber]. [amber]{1}[/amber] people, gone in one satisfying
    little mushroom. A whole real country for a clean scan. Bold trade. I would never
    have dared, and you did it with your thumb.
  _hugeJab: '[amber]{0}.[/amber] [amber]{1}[/amber] people. You did not pick a country,
    you picked a small civilisation, and the button did not blink and neither did
    you. Cancer is cured. So is [amber]{0}[/amber], in a manner of speaking.'
  _selfCountryJab: Oh. Oh, this is delicious. [amber]{0}[/amber]. That is yours,
    is it not. Home. [amber]{1}[/amber] of your very own, and your thumb did not
    so much as twitch. Whatever they say about you at the end, they cannot say you
    played favourites.
  _tinyBelow: 100000
  _smallBelow: 5000000
  _hugeAtLeast: 100000000
  _pressLabel: Press it
  _refuseLabel: Refuse
  _advanceLockout: 0.3
  _preMapBeat: 0.3
  _postPinBeat: 0.35
  _reactHold: 0.4
  _statsFade: 0.5
  _statsHideFade: 0.6
  _teardownFade: 0.5
  _countries:
  - Name: Vatican City
    Iso: VA
    Population: 800
    Pin: {x: 0.069, y: 0.466}
    Quip: The [amber]Vatican[/amber]. Eight hundred people and the odd infallible
      one. You aimed a nuclear weapon at God's landlord to cure a cough. I am beside
      myself.
  - Name: Nauru
    Iso: NR
    Population: 11000
    Pin: {x: 0.927, y: -0.006}
    Quip: 
  - Name: Tuvalu
