MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1577463767}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 220a3de2e12d0dc4db37a5193ee1f182, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.BetterOfferBeat
  _note: 
  _crownedPrefab: {fileID: 6980539495787555654, guid: b35c6ea894415a04da58b979849070c8, type: 3}
  _inkMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 5556814e11032244ab3e6a5098e86fae, type: 2}
  _font: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 579a746deee295d4682ed64faa1cf59d, type: 2}
  _figurePosition: {x: 0, y: -0.6}
  _figureScale: 1.7
  _goldColor: {r: 0.859, g: 0.706, b: 0.278, a: 1}
  _inkInDuration: 0.9
  _buttonPosition: {x: 2.7, y: 0.3}
  _buttonRadius: 0.7
  _buttonLineWidth: 0.055
  _buttonSorting: 14
  _buttonFadeIn: 0.4
  _buttonFadeOut: 0.35
  _takeSeed: 37
  _keepSeed: 63
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _takeStatLabel: took the better life
  _keepStatLabel: kept their own
  _identityNudge: 0.08
  _sellLines:
  - Different button. Look at this one first.
  - There. That is the best life a human being has ever actually lived. Every door
    opened. Every love returned. Not one day of it wasted. A [gold]golden[/gold]
    little existence, first breath to last.
  - Press the button and you become this person. Completely. Their memories, their
    joy, all of it yours.
  - But not you. [amber]You[/amber] would be gone. No trace left. The happy one over
    there would not be the man who ended drunk behind the wheel. It would be them.
    Flawless, and not yours.
  - So. Take the best life anyone has ever had and stop being you. Or keep your own,
    the one that ended in a ditch, and stay exactly who you are. Choose.
  _tookReact: Gone. You traded yourself away for a stranger's paradise. Somewhere
    a person is perfectly, endlessly happy, and it is not you, because there is no
    more you to enjoy it. You wiped out a whole self just to stop being the one you
    were. I do hope it was worth it. You will not be around to say.
  _keptReact: You kept it. Your own grubby little life, the one that drove itself
    into a wall. Flawless, endless happiness on offer, and you said no, because it
    would not have been [amber]yours[/amber]. You clung to being you, right down
    to the drink and the wreck. Sentimental. Or vain. I can never tell the two apart,
    and neither can you.
  _takeLabel: Take their life
  _keepLabel: Keep your own
  _advanceLockout: 0.3
  _reactHold: 0.4
  _drainDuration: 0.7
  _fadeDuration: 1.1
  _statsFade: 0.5
  _statsHideFade: 0.6
