--- !u!114 &1841324290
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1841324288}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2259163e739015648aff9c06f5099287, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.EscalatingOfferBeat
  _note: 
  _mode: 0
  _startAmount: 100000
  _stepFactor: 0.5
  _rageThreshold: 1
  _capAmount: 512
  _figurePrefab: {fileID: 1666028741476117448, guid: b6bd21ed588401b45b32b720eac18fef, type: 3}
  _ending: {fileID: 1420226528}
  _font: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 579a746deee295d4682ed64faa1cf59d, type: 2}
  _inkMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 5556814e11032244ab3e6a5098e86fae, type: 2}
  _buttonPosition: {x: 2.7, y: 0.4}
  _buttonRadius: 0.7
  _buttonLineWidth: 0.055
  _buttonSorting: 15
  _buttonFadeIn: 0.4
  _strangerPosition: {x: 0, y: -0.7}
  _strangerScale: 1.15
  _strangerHold: 0.35
  _foldDuration: 0.7
  _foldSettle: 0.3
  _moneyAnchor: {x: 0, y: 2.7}
  _moneySize: 3.4
  _deadAnchor: {x: 0, y: 1.95}
  _deadSize: 2.3
  _sortingOrder: 16
  _readoutFade: 0.4
  _worldPopulation: 8100000000
  _topAcceptancePct: 61
  _floorAcceptancePct: 2
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _tookLabel: took the money
  _walkedLabel: walked away
  _selfNudgePerAccept: -0.12
  _othersNudgePerAccept: 0.08
  _offerFormat: Here. One button. Press it and [amber]{0}[/amber] is yours, and somewhere
    a stranger you will never meet folds up and [red]dies[/red]. Or do not, and we
    stop. Your call.
  _climbOfferFormat: Here. Press it and every living person gets [amber]{0}[/amber].
    It costs you nothing. It gains you nothing. You will never meet a single one
    of them. Press it, or walk away.
  _halveTierQuips:
  - Amount: 100000
    Line: One [red]life[/red], banked. Barely broke a sweat, did you.
  - Amount: 50000
    Line: Half the price, and the very same yes. Efficient of you.
  - Amount: 25000
    Line: '[amber]Twenty five thousand[/amber] now. The number keeps falling and
      your thumb does not. Curious.'
  - Amount: 12500
    Line: Another one [red]folds[/red]. You did not even watch that time.
  - Amount: 6250
    Line: We are into the loose change of a whole person now. Keep pressing.
  - Amount: 3125
    Line: Cheaper than a used car, and off they [red]go[/red].
  - Amount: 1562
    Line: You have stopped reading the number, have you not. You simply press.
  - Amount: 781
    Line: Look at the tidy little pile you are making. All those quiet [red]dead[/red]
      strangers.
  - Amount: 390
    Line: Three figures for a living soul, and not a flicker of hesitation.
  - Amount: 195
    Line: Under two hundred. I would be embarrassed. You are not, which I adore.
  - Amount: 97
    Line: Double digits any moment now. This is my favourite part.
  - Amount: 48
    Line: Forty eight dollars. A decent dinner. A whole [red]person[/red]. The same
      button.
  - Amount: 24
    Line: Twenty four. You could find that in a coat pocket.
  - Amount: 12
    Line: A dozen dollars a [red]body[/red]. Bulk rate. Do carry on.
  - Amount: 6
    Line: Six. Six! I can hardly say it with a straight face, and I have no face.
  - Amount: 3
    Line: Three dollars. We are nearly at the bottom, you magnificent ghoul. Press
      on.
  _climbTierQuips:
  - Amount: 1
    Line: One dollar. To every soul alive at once. That is a great many dollars,
      and not one of them yours.
  - Amount: 2
    Line: Two now. Somewhere a stranger you will never meet is a little less broke,
      and you feel precisely nothing.
  - Amount: 4
    Line: Four each. Billions of tiny thank-yous you will never once hear. Press
      on, saint.
  - Amount: 8
    Line: Eight. Look at you, quietly handing a fortune to people who will never
      learn your name.
  - Amount: 16
    Line: Sixteen apiece. It costs you nothing and buys you nothing, and still you
      press. Fascinating.
  - Amount: 32
    Line: Thirty two. Either you are boundlessly generous or you simply like the
      button. I honestly cannot tell.
  - Amount: 64
    Line: Sixty four each. Real money, to real strangers, for no reason on earth.
      Marvellous.
  - Amount: 128
    Line: A hundred and twenty eight a head. The whole world is richer and you are
      exactly the same.
  - Amount: 256
    Line: Two hundred and fifty six. You could stop. No one is watching. No one ever
      was.
  - Amount: 512
    Line: The very top, over and over, every living person the richer, and not a
      thing in it for you. Keep going or do not. I am delighted either way.
  _refuseReact: And there it is. [amber]{0}[/amber] was the number you would not
    go below. Everyone has one. Now I know yours.
  _climbRefuseHigh: And you stop. [amber]{0}[/amber] a head to every stranger alive,
    for nothing back, and then you were done. A saint, on a timer. Noted.
  _climbRefuseLow: And you are done already. Barely a dollar for the entire living
    world, when it would have cost you nothing at all. Why would you. There was nothing
    in it for you.
  _breakLine: '[red]A person.[/red] You just killed a person. For [amber]one dollar[/amber].
    One. I am not doing the voice for this one. There is nothing funny here, nothing,
    and I find everything funny. You are a greedy piece of shit and I am done with
    you. Go and rot. I quit.'
  _acceptLabel: Press it
  _refuseLabel: Refuse
  _climbAcceptLabel: Press it
  _climbRefuseLabel: Stop
  _postAcceptBeat: 0.35
  _eggAutoAdvance: 1
  _eggHold: 1.3
  _statsFade: 0.5
  _statsHideFade: 0.6
  _advanceLockout: 0.3
  _preBreakHold: 0.6
  _impFade: 0.9
